<section class="section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up"><div class="section-divider"></div><span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> Key Features</span><h2 class="section-title">Delivery Customer Features</h2><p class="section-subtitle">A complete subscription milk delivery experience for every customer.</p></div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i></div><h3>Flexible Subscriptions</h3><p>Daily, alternate day, or custom delivery schedules. Change frequency anytime without calling.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-map-location-dot"></i></div><h3>Real-Time Tracking</h3><p>Track your delivery partner live on the map. Know exactly when your milk arrives.</p></div></div>
