      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-rupee-sign"></i></div><h3>Digital Payments</h3><p>Pay via UPI, wallet, or set up auto-pay monthly. No more cash for daily milk payments.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-clock-rotate-left"></i></div><h3>Delivery History</h3><p>View complete delivery history, missed deliveries, and payment receipts in one place.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></div><h3>Delivery Notifications</h3><p>Get notified when your delivery is 10 minutes away. Never miss a delivery or get confused about timing.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-cart-shopping"></i></div><h3>Multiple Products</h3><p>Order milk, curd, paneer, and more bovin products from your trusted local bovin supplier.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div><h3>Rate &amp; Review</h3><p>Rate your delivery and provide feedback directly in the app. Improve service quality together.</p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-gift"></i></div><h3>Loyalty Rewards</h3><p>Earn points on every delivery. Redeem for discounts, free products, or subscription upgrades.</p></div></div>
