<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section-padding bg-light-green">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-circle-question"></i> FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <span class="accent">Questions</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about BoviNetra milk delivery subscription.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="accordion accordion-flush faq-accordion" id="faqDelivery">
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd1">How do I pause my subscription?</button></h2><div id="fd1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">You can pause your subscription directly from the app. Go to My Subscription → Pause Delivery, select the dates, and confirm. Your billing is automatically adjusted for the paused days.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd2">Can I change my delivery address?</button></h2><div id="fd2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, you can update your delivery address from the app's Account Settings. Changes take effect from the next delivery. Contact support if you need immediate address updates.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd3">What payment methods are accepted?</button></h2><div id="fd3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">We accept UPI (PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm), debit/credit cards, net banking, and wallet payments. You can also set up monthly auto-debit for hassle-free payments.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd4">What happens if my delivery is missed?</button></h2><div id="fd4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">If a delivery is missed, you'll receive an instant notification. You can report it in the app and your account will be credited. We also notify your delivery partner automatically to resolve the issue.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd5">Can I order other bovin products besides milk?</button></h2><div id="fd5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">Yes! You can order curd, paneer, ghee, buttermilk, and other bovin products from your local supplier through the Shop section of the app. Availability depends on your local bovin provider.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fd6">Is there a minimum subscription duration?</button></h2><div id="fd6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqDelivery"><div class="accordion-body">No minimum commitment. You can subscribe month-to-month and cancel anytime. There are no cancellation fees or lock-in periods.</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

